        "cooked": "<p>I didn't participate in this last year, since I didn't have access to my decks while it was going on (and I don't really enjoy solo games using the cards), but I was thinking of trying it now that we have a significant portion of the game in the video game. &nbsp;But that only works until the fourth game, which requires Freedom Tower. &nbsp;What would you suggest as an acceptable substitute to Freedom Tower and/or the Mobile Defense Platform?</p>",
